    <ferc:DescriptionForOtherAdjustmentsByOutsideSourcesToCashFlowsFromFinancingActivities id="f-194" contextRef="c-17">Contribution from partner</ferc:DescriptionForOtherAdjustmentsByOutsideSourcesToCashFlowsFromFinancingActivities>
    <ferc:OrderNumber id="f-195" contextRef="c-17" unitRef="u-06" decimals="0">1</ferc:OrderNumber>
    <ferc:OtherAdjustmentsByOutsideSourcesToCashFlowsFromFinancingActivities id="f-196" contextRef="c-17" unitRef="u-02" xsi:nil="true" />
    <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-198" contextRef="c-06">&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma; font-weight: bold"&gt;The Company &lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma; font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;Baton Rouge Pipeline LLC (Baton Rouge Pipeline) is a Delaware limited liability company and a wholly-owned subsidiary of Baton Rouge Fractionators LLC, also a Delaware limited liability company. Baton Rouge Fractionators LLC is owned 32.25% by Enterprise Products Operating LLC, a Texas limited liability company, 31.44% by Williams Field Services Group, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company, 19.44% by Amoco Louisiana Fractionator Company, a Delaware corporation and 16.87% by Exxon Chemical Louisiana LLC (ExxonMobil), a Delaware limited liability company. Baton Rouge Pipeline is physically operated by ExxonMobil.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma; font-weight: bold"&gt;Basis of Accounting&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma; font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;The accounting policies followed in preparation of these financial statements conform to those required by FERC. Financial statements are prepared on the accrual basis of accounting. &lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma; font-weight: bold"&gt;Description of the Property&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma; font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;Baton Rouge Pipeline leases a 12&amp;quot; natural gas liquids (NGL) pipeline that is approximately 40 miles in length and located entirely within the State of Louisiana. The lease is recorded as a capital lease. The pipeline receives NGLs from WILPRISE Pipeline Company, LLC and ExxonMobil plants and storage wells and delivers NGLs to the Baton Rouge Fractionator located in West Baton Rouge Parish, Louisiana. &lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma; font-weight: bold"&gt;Revenue Recognition&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma; font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;Baton Rouge Pipeline revenues are derived from transportation of NGLs under tariffs regulated by the FERC. The tariffs specify the amounts to be paid by shippers for service between receipt and delivery locations and the general terms and conditions of transportation services on the pipeline system. Revenues are recorded upon delivery of products to customers. &lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma; font-weight: bold"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma; font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;Baton Rouge Pipeline is a limited liability company that passes income tax liability through the company to the unitholders and does not recognize this liability on the company's financial statements. For purposes of calculating the income tax expense and liability for the annual cost of service (shown on page 700 of the Annual Report) Baton Rouge Pipeline employs FERC's Policy Statement on Income Tax Allowances.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma; font-weight: bold"&gt;Employees&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma; font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;Baton Rouge Pipeline has no employees of its own. Field operations are performed by employees of ExxonMobil pursuant to an operating agreement. Management and administrative functions are performed by employees of Enterprise Products Company.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 		&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
